 at <a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/room/fse-2025/fse-2025-venue-cosmos-hall\" class=\"room-link navigate\">Cosmos Hall</a></strong> - <a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/track/fse-2025/fse-2025-research-papers#program\" class=\"navigate\">Code Generation 2</a> <small>Chair(s): <a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/fse-2025/reyhanehjabbarvand\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\">Reyhaneh Jabbarvand</a></small><div class=\"text-muted\">Info for room <strong>Cosmos Hall</strong>: </div><blockquote class=\"info-participants\"><p>This is the main event hall of Clarion Hotel, which will be used to host keynote talks and other plenary sessions. The FSE and ISSTA banquets will also happen in this room.</p>\n<p>The room is just in front of the registration desk, on the other side of the main conference area. The large doors with numbers \u201C1\u201D and \u201C2\u201D provide access to the Cosmos Hall.</p>\n</blockquote></div></div></div></div><div class=\"modal-footer\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/details/fse-2025/fse-2025-research-papers/76/Beyond-Functional-Correctness-Investigating-Coding-Style-Inconsistencies-in-Large-La\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default navigate\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-new-window\"></span> All Details</a></span><a href=\"#\" data-dismiss=\"modal\" class=\"btn btn-default\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-remove\"></span> Close</a></div></div></div></div>"},{ "action": "runscript", "value": "$('#modal-d735475d-5c4c-4d99-bf51-3fd707cf0e43').modal({ backdrop: 'static', keyboard: true}, 'show');" },
